      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1893-11-11_WidnesExaminer_art0074" n="art0074">
        <head>PROPOSED_ WARDS FOR NEWTON.</head>
        <p>PROPOSED_ WARDS FOR NEWTON.</p>
        <p>DEPUTATION TO THE NEWTON COMMIS-</p>
        <p>SIONERS..</p>
