        <p>BROOKE, BOND &amp; Co. Think of the millions of men, women, and chil- dren in our teeming land and then realise that Brooke, Bond &amp; Co. supply one out of every thirty in those myriads with Tea. THAT FACT IS THE BEST PROOF OF VALUE. WE DO NOT FEAR COMPETITION, and we court comparison, for our position is impregnable. WHY? BECAUSE we buy for " cash " and sell for " cash " many million pounds of Tea every year; so we can sell and do sell every pound for the smallest profit. We deal In TEA ONLY. It is plain indeed that a firm which devotes all its attention to Tea alone must give the Public the best possible value in Tea. Our gigantic business has been established twenty-three years, our reputation is so high, and we have altogether so much at stake that we are thus bound by the best and surest of all guaran- tees to do the utmost possible for the Public and far you. WILL YOU NOW TRY THE TEA ITSELF? It is sold in One-pound, Half-pound, and Quarter. pound Packets. Each is prepared and sealed by us at our Own Warehouses, and bears our Signature and celebrated Trade Mark of the double-triangle or six-pointed star. OUR AGENTS draw their supplies constantly from us, and they sell exactly the same Tea at the same prices as at our celebrated warehouses. IV-, 1/2, 1/4, 1/8, 2/, 2/4 Or 2/8 per lb. WE ARE GLAD to receive applications for Agencies in this District from energetic trades- people. Selling our Tea is already a regular annuity to thousands of enterprising men and women. BROOKE, BOND, &amp; CO., LIMITED, 17, PICCADILLY, MANCHESTER, AND AT LEEDS. BRADFORD. AND LONDON.</p>
